  "validationNotes": {
    "resolvedAttempts": "The initial evolution fixture accidentally used Plasma Chaser dm02-002, which is not an evolution. Corrected to actual Crystal Lancer dm02-024 in the new tests and the existing QA35471 regression. Universe fixture corrected from nonexistent dmex01-021 to registered dmex01-022. Death-draw assertion now accounts for the three ordinary shield cards entering hand after Jura attack. Advanced fixtures account for automatic single-partner awakening and the required noBlock step before a shield trigger. Final52 focused tests all pass.",
    "sharedChanges": "Native physicalCardSweep accepts a guarded nondestruction flag and serializable mana-grave references, preserving one selection batch, replacement window and physical source handling. Selected God and Psychic component identities can be reserved together without another unrelated card choice; old single-part defaults stay unchanged. Shirahano reserves both optional pairs and all physical-owner Aura ordering choices before the first same-zone move, reusing factored Sixfall commit behavior. Native seed.noLose adds an active global direct-only guard without a new schema or changed saved IDs.",
    "existingTestCorrection": "tests/standard1803-effects.test.mjs QA35471 now uses actual Crystal Lancer dm02-024 rather than Plasma Chaser; production definitions unchanged. Full related regression includes this correction.",
    "imageReview": "All7 exact-name official images reviewed, including3 Jura,1 Shirahano,3 Judge; mana1 and full faces/basic info checked."
  }
